This whole thing with the save game file copy level to another file, then
double your stuff by copying it back.  I mean I won't flame your or say
they are cheating, but I wouldn't really consider these as spoilers or tricks
in the game.  I mean to me this is along the same line as:

HEY! Really cool spoiler.. If you go into the nethack source and change it so
Priests ALWAYS start with 3 WoWs, the game is much easier.

Spoilers and really good nethack tricks should be done from within the game.
Anything requiring you to shell out and to tricks with the nethack files do
not constitute spoilers in my book. (They are just about as fun as modifying
monst.c so all monsters have 1 hp).

